    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: 'Whispers in the Wall



    The hallway hums, the air stands still,

    Yet
    something calls against my will.



    A hollow sound, a hidden space,

    A
    whisper lost without a trace.



    Not all walls are what they seem,

    Some
    hold secrets, some hold dreams.'
