    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.32
  m_Text: "The notes drifted from the music box like whispers from another time.
    They told a story of longing, of love lost in the echoes of silence. As I listened,
    I felt the sorrow settle deep within me. It was not enough to hear\u2014I needed
    to answer. If the music carried this soul\u2019s grief, then perhaps, played
    aloud, it could offer her peace. I must gather the musicians. We must complete
    the symphony and give voice to what was left unsung."
