  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 5e66e77026a31924e936fc62ef1e97b9, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 43
    m_FontStyle: 1
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 300
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.35
  m_Text: 'July 12, 1983


    The world shattered the day Seraphina left. Her laughter,
    once the melody of my life, now echoes as a mournful dirge. Without her, the
    music loses its soul, each note a poignant reminder of an irreplaceable love.
    How can I find solace when the symphony of my heart is incomplete?

'
