  m_Text: "The broken clock symbolizes the composer\u2019s grief and feeling of being
    trapped in time, but it does not define \u2018melancholic\u2019 in the context
    of his music. The unfinished, untitled music sheet directly reflects the shift
    in his compositions\u2014his sorrow embedded in each note."
