  m_Text: My dearest, the night is upon us, and I wait where we once promised to
    meet. I have held on to hope, to the music, to the dream that we would share
    one last dance beneath the golden light. But the hours pass, and still, you do
    not come. Tell me, was it all a lie? Have I been forgotten?
